                      "color": {
                        "b": 109,
                        "g": 230,
                        "r": 255,
                        "textB": 0,
                        "textG": 0,
                        "textR": 0
                      },
                      "comment": "Begin the dash, depending on whether the player is flipped or not.\nThe length is used more as a speed here, since the timer is what decides when it stops."
                    },
